How to install:
1. Get source code via "git clone <url>" into directory <main>
2.1 For the examples to work as they are, you should do 
cd TUX_Processing
mkdir build
cd build
cmake ../
make
./biro_proc ../examples/json_files/<name>.json

2.2 You can also create the build directory anywhere then it is:
mkdir build
cmake <path_to_TUX_Processing/>
make 
./biro_proc <path_to_json>.json
But then adjust the paths in the example json files.


